BEGIN:VEVENT
DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://tfl.gov.uk/tube-dlr-overground/status/?Input=&lineIds=&dateTypeSelect=Future%20date&direction=&startDate=2026-10-20T08:20:37&endDate=2026-10-21T00:29:00">Disruption map.</a>\n\nSevere delays between Reading and Hayes & Harlington\, and MINOR DELAYS between Hayes & Harlington and Paddington due to an earlier bridge strike at Langley. GOOD SERVICE on the rest of the line. 
