BEGIN:VEVENT
DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://tfl.gov.uk/tube-dlr-overground/status/?Input=&lineIds=&dateTypeSelect=Future%20date&direction=&startDate=2026-10-22T22:00:00&endDate=2026-10-22T22:59:00">Disruption map.</a>\n\nELIZABETH LINE: Monday 19\, Tuesday 20\, Wednesday 21 and Thursday 22 October\, the 2217 Abbey Wood to Reading train will terminate at Maidenhead. Customers travelling to Twyford and Reading should change at Maidenhead to the 2338 GWR service to Twyford and Reading. At Maidenhead\, connecting westbound GWR trains to Twyford and Reading use Platform 1. For step-free interchange from platform 3 to platform 1\, please use the lift to the main entrance\, and then continue at street level under the railway bridge and up Shoppenhangers Road to the car park. Please ask staff to open the gate to platform 1\, and allow extra time for your journey. The 2317 Reading to Paddington train is revised to start at Maidenhead at 2333\, a later GWR service operates at 2350 from Reading to Paddington calling at Twyford\, Reading and Slough
DTEND:20261022T225900Z
DTSTART:20261022T220000Z
SUMMARY:Elizabeth line: Reduced Service
UID:c1ed9128-f4e0-41f0-b9c4-e7a747b5b0f8@c1ed.org
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://tfl.gov.uk/tube-dlr-overground/status/?Input=&lineIds=&dateTypeSelect=Future%20date&direction=&startDate=2026-10-25T04:30:00&endDate=2026-10-26T01:29:00">Disruption map.</a>\n\nELIZABETH LINE: Sunday 25 October\, a reduced service operates between Hayes & Harlington and Maidenhead. Two trains an hour serve West Drayton\, Langley\, Slough\, Burnham and Maidenhead. From 1100 until 1900\, westbound trains will not call at Burnham or Taplow\, and after 1900\, no trains call at Burnham or Taplow. Replacement bus service W3 operates between Slough and Maidenhead via Burnham and Taplow. At Maidenhead\, from 1100\, westbound trains to Twyford and Reading use Platform 1. For step-free interchange from platform 3 to platform 1\, please use the lift to the main entrance\, and then continue at street level under the railway bridge and up Shoppenhangers Road to the car park. Please ask staff to open the gate to platform 1\, and allow extra time for your journey
DTEND:20261026T012900Z
DTSTART:20261025T043000Z
SUMMARY:Elizabeth line: Reduced Service
UID:a1abe0c5-7a71-4053-b32b-9e06f4c64e54@a1ab.org
END:VEVENT
